ega tehisharu teeb ka vigu.

1802
01:47:35.610 --> 01:47:38.450
Aga nende vigade kontrollimiseks

1803
01:47:38.550 --> 01:47:40.675
Just,

1804
01:47:47.250 --> 01:47:51.729
