1909
01:53:42.729 --> 01:53:44.629
Nii, nüüd ma annangi.

1910
01:53:44.729 --> 01:53:48.810
Juhan, mina olgu, ma segan,
kas siin on mingisuguseid erilisi

1911
01:53:48.810 --> 01:53:51.890
